msgid "If you'd like to purchase chips, you can do so at the front desk."
msgstr "Si desea comprar más fichas, puede hacerlo en la mesa del frente."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "436_Dealer"
msgid "Welcome to the baccarat table. You can play one game for 1,000 chips. Would you like to play?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "460_Haruka"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! I wanna watch you play baccarat. Ooh, I bet you could get 1,000 points in a game!"
